{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The smaller stainless hose clamps feel relevant because I have bought hose clamps more than once; they connect to a repeated repair need.",
    "The J-B Weld epoxy fits my past tape and vinyl cement purchases as another way to make repairs when a stronger bond is needed."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The cutting wheels, threaded inserts and specific-size nuts require a matching tool or project that my purchases do not establish.",
    "The electronic cleaner and infrared thermometer suggest possible maintenance tasks, but I have no current need for cleaning components or measuring temperature.",
    "Gorilla glue fits my interest in adhesives, but ten containers are more than I need now, so relevance alone would not make me choose that pack."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Buying repair supplies seems to have been taken as a reason to offer almost any workshop hardware, even when its purpose is quite different.",
    "My electrical connectors and inspection camera seem to suggest more specialized troubleshooting needs than I have actually shown."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Repeated hose clamp purchases give me a clearer reason to consider similar clamps than unrelated nuts or inserts, although the size still needs to fit my repair.",
    "I choose supplies for a particular use, so compatible dimensions, required tools and a useful pack quantity matter alongside a familiar repair purpose."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my practical repair interests but stretched them into specialized tasks and quantities I have little reason to choose now."
}"}
